  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Phozzle: Photo Sliding Puzzle",
      "description": "Phozzle – Rediscover Your Moments\nHow many photos are on your phone? Hundreds? Thousands? Most of them forgotten, buried in your library, never to be seen again.\nPhozzle brings them back to life.\n\nTurn your forgotten snapshots into engaging sliding puzzles. That beach vacation from two years ago? Your child's first birthday? A spontaneous moment with friends? Rediscover them all – one puzzle at a time.\n\nWhy You'll Love Phozzle\nEvery puzzle is personal. No stock images, no random pictures – just your own pictures waiting to be rediscovered. Slide the tiles, reveal the image, and let the moments come flooding back.\n\nFeatures\n◆ Your Photos, Your Puzzles – Uses images from your personal library \n◆ Three Difficulty Levels – 3x3, 4x4, or 5x5 grids \n◆ Daily Challenge – A new puzzle every day featuring your photos \n◆ Smart Photo Selection – Automatically filters out screenshots and documents \n◆ Album Organization – Choose photos from specific albums \n◆ Game Center – Compete on leaderboards and unlock achievements \n◆ Daily Reminders – Never miss your daily challenge \n◆ Beautiful Design – Clean, modern interface with dark mode support\n\nMore Than Just a Game\nSliding puzzles sharpen your mind – improving spatial reasoning, problem-solving, and focus. But Phozzle offers something more: a reason to smile when a long-forgotten photo appears on your screen.\n\nFree to Start\nPlay your first 5 puzzles for free. Unlock unlimited puzzles with a single purchase – no subscriptions, no ads. The number of puzzles is only limited by the number of photos on your device.\n\nYour pictures deserve to be seen again. Download Phozzle and start rediscovering.",
      "releaseNotes": "- Code optimizations\n- Bug fixes",
